# STALE: this expectation cannot be verified on this baseline. `import io` plus
# `import path` is a multi-module graph, and AOT is fail-closed on migrated stdlib
# modules here -- the dump command fails with XR_TARGET_1000 before a single
# c_contains line is evaluated (tests/aot/run_aot_filetests.py takes the "dump
# command failed" branch). Whoever first gets this case to build again must
# re-derive every line below from real `--dump-xaot-plan --dump-link-manifest`
# output rather than editing it by hand.
#
# Lines the io write-side migration invalidated (lane 6-9, branch
# work/6-9-io-write-leaf-34be0379c): xrt_io_write_file, xrt_io_append_file,
# xrt_io_write_file_bytes and xrt_io_copy_file no longer exist -- the six write
# leaves were replaced by the descriptor-based __fileOpenWrite/__fileWrite/
# __fileWriteStr/__fileFlush set, so writeFile/appendFile/writeFileBytes/copyFile
# are now Xray bodies in stdlib/io/io.xr over xrt_io_file_open_write and
# xrt_io_write_handle_chunk/_str. Those four c_contains lines are removed below
# and the four new entry points added in their place.
#
# The read and path-metadata cutover removed xrt_io_read_file,
# xrt_io_read_file_bytes, xrt_io_exists, xrt_io_file_size, xrt_io_is_file,
# xrt_io_is_dir and xrt_io_is_symlink. Whole-input buffering now composes the
# descriptor leaves, while every metadata query projects the single xrt_io_stat
# leaf in io.xr.
#
# Lines that were already stale before that migration, left as they are because
# this lane did not cause them and cannot verify a replacement: xrt_io_temp_dir,
# xrt_io_mkdirp, xrt_io_touch, xrt_io_read_dir_recursive and xrt_io_remove_all
# name C entry points that no longer exist either -- tempDir, mkdirp, touch,
# readDirRecursive and removeAll became Xray bodies in an earlier round.
#
# DELETE THIS COMMENT when the case builds again and every line has been
# re-derived from real output.

contains=xaot-plan v0
contains="generated_c_files": ["<aot-generated-c>"]
contains="runtime_caps": ["coro", "objects"]
contains="runtime_objects": ["xray_rt_coro"]
contains="stdlib_objects": []
contains="stdlib_symbols": ["path.Path", "io.tempDir", "path.join", "path.from", "io.mkdirp", "io.isDir", "io.writeFile", "io.exists", "io.isFile", "io.fileSize", "io.readFile", "io.appendFile", "io.readLines", "io.writeFileBytes", "io.readFileBytes", "io.copyFile", "io.rename", "io.stat", "io.touch", "io.chmod", "io.readDir", "io.readDirRecursive", "io.realpath", "io.cwd", "io.chdir", "io.symlink", "io.isSymlink", "io.readlink", "io.tempFile", "io.remove", "io.removeAll"]
contains="system_libs": ["m", "pthread"]
contains="defines": ["XRT_IMPL"]
not_contains="runtime_objects": ["xray_core"]
not_contains="stdlib_objects": ["io"]
c_contains=xrt_io_temp_dir(
c_contains=xrt_io_mkdirp(
c_contains=xrt_io_file_open(
c_contains=xrt_io_file_open_write(
c_contains=xrt_io_write_handle_chunk(
c_contains=xrt_io_write_handle_str(
c_contains=xrt_io_file_close(
c_contains=xrt_io_read_handle_chunk(
c_contains=xrt_io_rename(
c_contains=xrt_io_stat(
c_contains=xrt_io_touch(
c_contains=xrt_io_chmod_value(
c_contains=xrt_io_read_dir(
c_contains=xrt_io_read_dir_recursive(
c_contains=xrt_io_realpath(
c_contains=xrt_io_cwd(
c_contains=xrt_io_chdir(
c_contains=xrt_io_symlink(
c_contains=xrt_io_readlink(
c_contains=xrt_io_temp_file(
c_contains=xrt_io_remove(
c_contains=xrt_io_remove_all(
c_contains=xrt_path_data(
c_contains=Path_toString_m(
